			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"朝倉"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 220310101,
					"content": "槍紮一線…喝！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310102,
					"content": "我來和你對練了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220310103,
					"content": "噢！是您啊閣下。您又接下我的委託了嗎？非常感謝！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310104,
					"content": "您這樣武藝高強的人願意和我對練，實在是太好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310105,
						220310110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310105,
					"content": "槍法比之前進步不少啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220310106,
					"content": "哈哈…您可不要再調侃我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310107,
					"content": "我聽說，槍這種武器發明的目的之一，就是讓我這種不怎麼精通武藝的人也能拿著它戰鬥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310108,
					"content": "畢竟這種武器又長又尖，就算是拿著的人不懂槍法，只是單純地戳刺和揮舞，看起來都很有氣勢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310109,
					"content": "不過，按這種原則…其實我感覺那種前面有三個尖的草叉更有威力…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310110,
					"content": "你不是已經拿回武器了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220310111,
					"content": "武器雖然已經拿回來了，但並不能代表修煉就到此為止了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310112,
					"content": "曾經會遇見海亂鬼這種傢伙，未來很難說不會遇見更強大的敵人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220310113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 220310113,
					"content": "絕不允許我的武器再次落入敵手，絕不允許武士榮耀再次受人踐踏，這就是我追求的武士之道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2203102,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
